OL,3,AKatie Price's ex urged girl not to
OL,4,Atell, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Price's ex-husband, who is
OL,7,Faccused of raping a 13-year-old girl,
OL,8,Ftold her to "not tell anyone" and said
OL,9,Fhe might "get in trouble for this", a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FKieran Hayler, 39, is on trial at Lewes
OL,13,FCrown Court accused of three counts of
OL,14,Frape and one count of sexual assault of
OL,15,Fthe teenager in West Sussex in 2016,
OL,16,Fall of which he denies.
OL,18,FEarlier, jurors were told that on the
OL,19,Ffirst alleged occasion, Hayler told the
OL,20,F13-year-old he really liked her and
OL,21,Fbegan speaking to her about having sex.
